    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">For positive integers <var>a</var> and <var>b</var>:<br>The  <strong>Greatest Common Divisor</strong>,  gcd(<var>a</var>,<var>b</var>) is the largest integer <var>c</var>, so that <var>c</var> divides both <var>a</var> and <var>b</var>.<br>The <strong>Least Common Multiple</strong>, lcm(<var>a</var>,<var>b</var>)  is the smallest integer <var>c</var>, so that <var>a</var> and <var>b</var> both divide <var>c</var>.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1</strong> three Integers separated by spaces <var>s</var>,<var>a</var>,<var>b</var> ; where <var>s</var> determines if the result should be  gcd(<var>a</var>,<var>b</var>) or lcm(<var>a</var>,<var>b</var>)</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">(if <var>s</var> is <const>1</const>): lcm(<var>a</var>,<var>b</var>)  <br>(if <var>s</var> is <const>-1</const>): gcd(<var>a</var>,<var>b</var>)</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><var>s</var> &isin; {-1,1}<br>0 &lt; <var>a</var> &lt; 10000<br>0 &lt; <var>b</var> &lt; 10000</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">1 2 3</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">6